/.bundle/
/.yardoc
/_yardoc/
/coverage/
/doc/
/pkg/
/spec/reports/
/tmp/

# Appraisal lockfiles are REGENERATED by CI on every run
# (`appraisal <name> bundle install`), so a committed one is never the input
# anything is actually tested against. Tracking them bought nothing and hid
# staleness: both sat at modelrails_ui 0.9.0 from PR #115 until 0.17.0, eight
# minor versions, without a single job noticing.
#
# If pinned appraisal builds are ever wanted, tracking these is not enough on
# its own — the CI install step has to run frozen, so drift fails loudly
# instead of being silently rewritten.
/gemfiles/*.gemfile.lock
